    "body": "@foolip, do you by chance know the history of \"Step 7.2\" (see Chrome's implementation) and why it's no longer in the spec? \r\n\r\nWebKit will follow Chrome's behavior as otherwise [it affects YouTube](https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pull/10834), but it would be good to figure this out as, right now, the we both don't follow the spec. ",
