    "body": "Sorry @nt1m @marcoscaceres, I missed this back when it was filed. I'll go through all open issues to see what else I've neglected.\n\nStep 7.2 in Chromium comes from https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/14eeb1d5b6369a4fefa57973bf6b646469f72e35 by @dtapuska. It was never landed in the spec, but it was in https://github.com/whatwg/fullscreen/pull/128, where I argued that we shouldn't have that step. I don't remember the details, but in the end we landed the PR without that step, with https://github.com/whatwg/fullscreen/issues/133 filed as a follow-up.\n\nSince that step is still what shipped, I think adding it to the spec is the correct first step for sure.",
